{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a murky journey with <i>Mind Keeper</i>, a dark tower defense game featuring roguelite progression, set in a creepy world of hand-drawn graphics crafted with pencil and paper. Become the architect of your own mental sanctuary, a stronghold symbolizing your inner resilience. As you construct and fortify your haven, face relentless waves of inner demons determined to erode the very foundations of your mental strength </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/DescriptionHeader.png?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mind integrity is fragile, human imagination can create horrors that can erode your sanity to the point of no return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/building.gif?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/DescriptionHeader2.png?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The true test lies beyond, in the epic boss encounters that unfold after surviving numerous waves. These encounters are not just battles; they are monumental clashes with unique mechanics, pushing your strategic skills and resilience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/boss.gif?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/DescriptionHeader3.png?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from a variety of power-ups to enhance your prowess, craft formidable builds by strategically combining different cards from your deck until you become utterly indestructible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/powerups.gif?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/extras/DescriptionHeader4.png?t=1749341276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a dynamic written narrative where your decisions shape the course of events.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2711210?t=1749341276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2711210?t=1749341276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749341276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749341276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2939230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a murky journey with <i>Mind Keeper</i>, a dark tower defense game featuring roguelite progression, set in a creepy world of hand-drawn graphics crafted with pencil and paper. Become the architect of your own mental sanctuary, a stronghold symbolizing your inner resilience. As you construct and fortify your haven, face relentless waves o